<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #faf7f2;
    }
    .approved {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dcfce7 0%, #bbf7d0 100%);
      border: 2px solid #22c55e;
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .rejected {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fee2e2 0%, #fecaca 100%);
      border: 2px solid #ef4444;
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .content {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid #e7e2d8;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #d97706;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .features-list {
      background: #f1ece3;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #57534e;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  {{#if approved}}
  <div class="approved">
    <h2>🎉 Congratulations, {{name}}!</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 18px;">Your trainer application has been <strong style="color: #15803d;">APPROVED</strong>!</p>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Welcome to the AICN Trainer Community! We're thrilled to have you on board.</p>
    
    <div class="features-list">
      <h3 style="color: #d97706; margin-top: 0;">✨ What you can do now:</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Create and manage training sessions</li>
        <li>Track attendance for your sessions</li>
        <li>Issue certificates to learners</li>
        <li>Access exclusive trainer dashboard</li>
        <li>View analytics and feedback</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="{{frontendUrl}}/trainer/dashboard" class="button">
        🚀 Go to Trainer Dashboard
      </a>
    </div>
    
    <p>Need help getting started? Contact our trainer support team at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #d97706;">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
  </div>
  {{else}}
  <div class="rejected">
    <h2> Trainer Application Update</h2>
    <p>Dear <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
    <p>Thank you for your interest in becoming a trainer with AICN.</p>
    <p>After careful review, we have decided not to proceed with your application at this time.</p>
    {{#if reason}}<p><strong>Reason:</strong> {{reason}}</p>{{/if}}
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <p>We encourage you to reapply in the future with additional qualifications or experience.</p>
    <p>You may also:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Continue as a learner to build your expertise</li>
      <li>Attend more sessions to understand our training methodology</li>
      <li>Gather more experience in your field</li>
    </ul>
    
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="{{frontendUrl}}/sessions" class="button">
        📚 Browse Learning Sessions
      </a>
    </div>
    
    <p>Questions? Contact us at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #d97706;">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
  <div class="footer">
    <p>© {{year}} AICN Training. All rights reserved.</p>
    <p>Africa ICT & CS Network — Empowering Africa Digitally, Transforming Lives</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>